---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Spend Easy - Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Spend Easy - Private Expense Tracker iOS app."
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/spend-easy/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mb-12">Spend Easy - Private Expense Tracker &middot; Effective February 15, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
            <p>Spend Easy does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. Your expense data never leaves your device. We will never ask for your bank login.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] border border-[var(--border-color)] rounded-xl p-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">🏦 No Bank Connections</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">Unlike many expense trackers, Spend Easy <strong>never</strong> connects to your bank account. We don't use Plaid, Yodlee, or any other financial data aggregator.</p>
            <p>You enter expenses manually, which means:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Your bank credentials stay private</li>
              <li>No third party ever sees your transactions</li>
              <li>You're in complete control of what gets tracked</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Data Storage</h2>
            <p>All expense data, budgets, categories, and settings are stored locally on your device using SwiftData. No data is sent to any server, cloud service, or third party. There are no user accounts and no sign-up required.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">No Cloud Sync</h2>
            <p>Spend Easy does not offer cloud synchronization. This is intentional. Your financial data stays on your device and is not uploaded anywhere. If you delete the app, your data is deleted with it.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Data Export</h2>
            <p>You can export your expense data to CSV format at any time. This file is created locally and you control where it goes. We never see your exported data.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Analytics & Tracking</h2>
            <p>Spend Easy contains no analytics frameworks, no ad SDKs, no tracking pixels, and no telemetry of any kind. We do not use any third-party services that collect data.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Network Usage</h2>
            <p>Spend Easy makes no network requests. The app works entirely offline. The only network activity associated with the app is through the App Store for updates.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Spend Easy does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>If this policy changes, we will update this page with the new effective date. Since Spend Easy collects no data, meaningful changes are unlikely.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-[var(--border-color)] pt-8">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Questions?</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about this privacy policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com?subject=Spend%20Easy%20Privacy%20Question" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
